      "title": "Accounting Part-Time Instructor (Adjunct) Position",
      "description": "Posted: 2025-01-09\n\nLocation: Reading\n\nAlvernia University’s Header School of Business is seeking applications for part-time (Adjunct) Instructor to teach the following Accounting undergraduate course in the Spring 2025 semester, starting 1/21/2025 and ending 5/2/2025.   BUS 253 Intermediate Accounting II: Mondays, Wednesdays, and Fridays from 1:25 PM to 2:15 PM   Please see the 2024-25 Undergraduate Catalog for the course description: https://catalog.alvernia.edu/   This course is offered in person at the John R. Post Center at Reading CollegeTowne, 401 Penn Street, Reading, PA, 19601.",
